msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫…………"

#: prologue:prologue_9C5985A3_A450_4279_89AD_E4C9055CB369
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e3060637939197299c883da401bcdc7776b85b2bc31fdb7f03ce0200f33c7586
#. default-sha256: 182e649e1c19da1717771311b07eeb8946af75595f7417509b971a04a53ef24f
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_9C5985A3_A450_4279_89AD_E4C9055CB369"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What’s the occasion? You never come to wake me up."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫你竟然叫我起床，⟪k:1⟫真少见呢。"

#: prologue:prologue_68962FD1_5789_4814_BF46_B3586D07440A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40c5f335090f726bc15f222a4a8bddd49d9b6cd017ce09d03b8e9c87e7ca1053
#. default-sha256: 774bf0f54662f9f2e8049ebcd4aad15127eecf7aafe656101e8f84b2dae10cc0
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_68962FD1_5789_4814_BF46_B3586D07440A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was merely concerned for your health.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You really should be sleeping in a "
"proper bed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫您在那里睡着了的话，⟪k:2⟫感冒了怎么办啊？"

#: prologue:prologue_CF9E89B3_32AE_40C3_9AFC_47CEAC6DA8C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 330868a9e66da460bbb61cad319c2dc9826c8fa7fca5d66d08a9c8d69a243e28
#. default-sha256: cbe87b9512e0856b1621d14b526f5fecb8b0a9ac8f635426aeb4ff790d479dbc
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_CF9E89B3_32AE_40C3_9AFC_47CEAC6DA8C3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You were ⟪k:3⟫concerned⟪k:4⟫? About ⟪k:5⟫me⟪k:6⟫?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫You do realize the "
"concept of “health” bears little meaning for either of us, don’t you?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫不会感冒的。⟪k:3⟫我已经不是那种凡人之躯了。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫……难道说，⟪k:6⟫你在担心我？"

#: prologue:prologue_42F500E6_AADF_4523_B5D0_46846E73867B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8c67278fec3cfe859ee135a6811bede8a2a62144b07924d54492bb58f69725a
#. default-sha256: 8936501e16db3f893721d3fa13b7cae7eff3bbbe5ae7b7fc697aad7d27f8c558
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_42F500E6_AADF_4523_B5D0_46846E73867B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Why would I not be concerned? ⟪k:2⟫You ⟪k:3⟫are⟪k:4⟫ me.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫If something were to "
"cause you to depart this world,⟪k:7⟫the same would happen to me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫是的，⟪k:2⟫因为您就是下仆啊？⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫您消失了的话，⟪k:5⟫下仆也会消失的。"

#: prologue:prologue_B351EC4B_885F_482C_B4CB_BCEFFF7E34F7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 120e13fc9f73b75f8e0168602529276efae3424466515980477fb77b3b63ed39
#. default-sha256: 4ea074f23738c5e3e7296a293a253d4f11c11e5595de42df6f908a99ca20a302
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_B351EC4B_885F_482C_B4CB_BCEFFF7E34F7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ahh... ⟪k:3⟫right.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫That’s true."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫啊……⟪k:3⟫是呢。⟪k:4⟫是这样的。"

#: prologue:prologue_219F44A4_AECD_4C4F_AFBA_6559324490AB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 70f67babc5a7dbdbefd3fa3cd15e6c3f6c554d2ae6a0f42baab15b72a6630898
#. default-sha256: 6c12a9d7290f94c882792882899bbb709738fa382e6ef7857606543c7390e8ab
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_219F44A4_AECD_4C4F_AFBA_6559324490AB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(It was so long ago, I almost forgot I told her she was me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And it would seem she "
"still believes that to be the case.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（好久以前，⟪k:1⟫我是这么说过呢。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　竟然深信不疑……）"

#: prologue:prologue_3BF7FF21_91E5_45AA_8A70_93A97AE211F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 92878c8b03301e96dca8ea87937d5ce7eec8ec15a2e67660a7e3781770613b23
#. default-sha256: 58a70da890d5d2ee69d2e6b7ae96eb0f2f3ea3b032114ac12e65a920a61aabe4
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_3BF7FF21_91E5_45AA_8A70_93A97AE211F1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Foolish woman.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（愚蠢的人啊……）"

#: prologue:prologue_2494829B_6EF8_4259_8A89_724BF8C2E9BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 721d68a84599b24cf4c57d7995cbd7e17c0b66e7f4fcbc7d721f4494c962b2f9
#. default-sha256: f3a62d31cfd2d68c7e45d56f6065f0486fe2e9c096dfed1b9d3683e2d9c16295
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_2494829B_6EF8_4259_8A89_724BF8C2E9BE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehe... ⟪k:2⟫What kind of herbal tea would you like to start your day with?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I "
"have some lovely mint leaves, if you would like.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫They are wonderful for improving one’s "
"mood."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫呵呵……⟪k:2⟫需要来杯醒神的香草茶吗？⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫为了让您心情好些，⟪k:5⟫要加些薄荷叶吗？"

#: prologue:prologue_A3379ACC_2922_40DF_B93A_42D0249E6756
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ddce448e9b611842f1a1cfcf2931710d453692a9d5c58d654e5ec00ad98c843
#. default-sha256: e8c73f0916535cac5c619a334d5ed1abd5bb254256f375f7028245e2d53e56d6
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_A3379ACC_2922_40DF_B93A_42D0249E6756"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I have no interest in—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫or need for—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫tea."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫茶也不要，⟪k:3⟫对我来说已经没有喝茶的必要了。"

#: prologue:prologue_2A7416EA_6EC3_4EC3_B482_0837EB84EE2E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c96b324ad37f894cce47911d87158ffc24d5d3806eef66bbe7f209d3f9b0c55
#. default-sha256: 6774d62052f79126cc150e847e2cb1565a7e6465c37e151c93cc1abb368945e7
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_2A7416EA_6EC3_4EC3_B482_0837EB84EE2E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That is most unfortunate."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫哎呀……⟪k:2⟫真遗憾。"

#: prologue:prologue_8FC837AF_E40A_4C1D_94F4_77A8DB4EDBD0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ca1f004c76e3a3906f0cccb89f92ccfe04eb78357219806830911071825e968
#. default-sha256: 91997c7cf1988f30de728f1da9b951331ec65af557e175914e79df4c3621aca4
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_8FC837AF_E40A_4C1D_94F4_77A8DB4EDBD0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫In that case, perhaps you could tell me a story?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……机会难得，⟪k:2⟫我们聊聊天吧？"

#: prologue:prologue_403866E0_6E4F_493B_A27C_2C7EAFE6329E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: abc964b469982e580e750d5602252e2235beec4d496db033a2160b9c6bc6cf22
#. default-sha256: 9b9c49886a12322c415967857b1a2d43a6c2aa6cb8111e1071a5b189ff0a2a73
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_403866E0_6E4F_493B_A27C_2C7EAFE6329E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A story?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You mean the one about Michel and Giselle again?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫聊天？⟪k:3⟫又是，⟪k:4⟫老生常谈的吉赛儿与米歇尔的故事吗？"

#: prologue:prologue_0B05D229_DD6F_426C_BBE6_F3909259CA5D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d20d8e35a594be377f753cf50dc01168c70488e162170a31faee8e80c589bc2
#. default-sha256: ad823bdf1e87a6b206041952afef83cc79711e15464ee0ca6d5120c289878e34
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_0B05D229_DD6F_426C_BBE6_F3909259CA5D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Yes, that one.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I do love that story oh so very much."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫嗯，⟪k:2⟫是的。⟪k:3⟫下仆最喜欢那个故事了。"

#: prologue:prologue_4604B25A_659B_44D1_9FFC_0469BC280F95
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8675d15f12f7e74efda8959b0463e2f49d5046fc21d45332439e31c4072e191a
#. default-sha256: 189ad8be47d6566c246b65d83268c73de2a2eaed6dc9fd45aa61cce7871d677e
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_4604B25A_659B_44D1_9FFC_0469BC280F95"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I, for one, am growing rather tired of it.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I’ve told it to you dozens of "
"times now."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫你不是已经说过好多次了吗，⟪k:3⟫即使是我也听厌了。"

#: prologue:prologue_DB2E9551_BD10_4F5E_B19B_02E32600B333
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f252c247c86aee213506c8968cf70a550563804f53b4d2ea11d16fcfe7f46944
#. default-sha256: 7d2b783fd0510a7def59b50bc7454f30616ebc2ac6777bb6d6396e423f09d617
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_DB2E9551_BD10_4F5E_B19B_02E32600B333"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Now, don’t be like that.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The best stories never stop being moving,⟪k:4⟫no "
"matter how many times you hear them."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫没关系，⟪k:2⟫美妙的故事无论听多少次都会感人至深的。"

#: prologue:prologue_FE9551A9_E7B3_4525_AC83_90F29E5824B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cdc16f2adda91fd984b3eb4605d36d6d1c8749f04898e8e03121b47ff2f89279
#. default-sha256: 2ffa961207451eec5545a72c0afd610eb5287355b73f3fae1634c95967430332
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_FE9551A9_E7B3_4525_AC83_90F29E5824B3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫(It’s like I’m talking to a child...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫（有点麻烦啊……）"

#: prologue:prologue_9A642A70_8B15_47C9_BD7B_BEB6E479AED8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 763a63d89b67f5e069b262fd3debc4550e111776da836c483f493dabf0f64ee9
#. default-sha256: a604da5d2b6eb2744ce8c48446a65dd9439dfc274d625b88c6cc5fb05ae5797d
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_9A642A70_8B15_47C9_BD7B_BEB6E479AED8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫All right, then, how about this? ⟪k:1⟫I’m going to ask you a question,⟪k:2⟫and if you give "
"me an answer I like, I’ll tell you the story again."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……那么，⟪k:1⟫要是我对你的回答满意的话，⟪k:2⟫就陪你聊天怎么样？"

#: prologue:prologue_37041A75_7016_4F96_B9C5_AD3F59AEC5F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2574b0fa55ac6bde356d1cc0e47d65915ae7f27252185944fc550c31e9fd8d58
#. default-sha256: 1c5fb8f755aabd1efa319c25c7f48754497ec7b6ad85c837ff1432f067934eb3
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_37041A75_7016_4F96_B9C5_AD3F59AEC5F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh? What kind of question?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫哎呀，⟪k:2⟫下仆该怎么回答呢。"

#: prologue:prologue_DDEDFAD1_E397_4B12_B05A_473A3CDE182C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13882df4e6e27b1638c4e2c34932283d2ca09641d59ad2464c50350ec7681f1e
#. default-sha256: cf22dd8da5f46f8e5fc5d209705a936d831b8fb3105dcc9bb5cb1bef80dc0e6a
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_DDEDFAD1_E397_4B12_B05A_473A3CDE182C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hehe... ⟪k:3⟫Nothing difficult, I promise.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I want to hear your opinion on "
"something."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫呵呵……⟪k:3⟫是简单的问题。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫我想知道你的想法。"

#: prologue:prologue_30C3C1BA_1D3D_4D6D_A3C5_556EB160ED24
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de92931823e69fae2e1c646e220cad307a4fa81607cdf494b271fb7f9ccad38e
#. default-sha256: 830f0e5fb53d711f59c96050b646e4d02c82f5c6183cb58bbf235f0206e60f5e
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_30C3C1BA_1D3D_4D6D_A3C5_556EB160ED24"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Do you think Giselle and Michel should be reunited?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫你觉得吉赛儿与米歇尔再一次相见比较好吗？"

#: prologue:prologue_CEB236E7_F5B6_4895_ABD8_938AE76C38C5
